          "text": "Busyomi busalala butakwe kampenda mumeso aa-Leza Taateesu mbombuboobu, bwakuti muntu aswaye bamusyaala abamukabafu mumapenzi aabo, akuliyobola cakutaba akabala nikaba komwe kaansi.",
